{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ContextSchema = Record<string, unknown>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L84","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:84"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ContextSchema - The shape of available tables/collections in a query context"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is simply a record mapping table aliases to their TypeScript types.\nIt evolves as the query progresses:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Initial: Just the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"from()"},{"type":"text","value":" table"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After joins: Includes all joined tables with proper optionality"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"In subqueries: May be a subset of the outer query's schema"}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ContextSchema = Record<string, unknown>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:84](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L84)\n\nContextSchema - The shape of available tables/collections in a query context\n\nThis is simply a record mapping table aliases to their TypeScript types.\nIt evolves as the query progresses:\n- Initial: Just the `from()` table\n- After joins: Includes all joined tables with proper optionality\n- In subqueries: May be a subset of the outer query's schema\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ContextSchema\ntitle: ContextSchema\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ContextSchema = Record<string, unknown>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:84](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L84)\n\nContextSchema - The shape of available tables/collections in a query context\n\nThis is simply a record mapping table aliases to their TypeScript types.\nIt evolves as the query progresses:\n- Initial: Just the `from()` table\n- After joins: Includes all joined tables with proper optionality\n- In subqueries: May be a subset of the outer query's schema\n"}
